| **G2.3** | Request Resources from Storage | ? | Perform | Resources requested from storage | AND | Direct interaction with storage. |
| **G2.4** | Wait for Retrieval | ? | Perform | Resources retrieved by storage | AND | Passive waiting for retrieval. |
| **G2.5** | Retrieve Resources | ? | Perform | Resources physically retrieved | AND | Final action to collect resources. |
| **G3** | Deliver Resources to Requesting Agent | # | Achieve | Resources delivered to destination | AND | Parallel delivery runs to handle multiple resources. |
| **G3.1** | Transport Resources to Destination | ? | Perform | Resources transported to location | AND | Multiple runs may be required. |

