|------|------|----------|----------|------------------|---------------|
| **AT1** | Move to Storage | AND | Storage Location | 1 | Single robot handles the movement to the storage. |
| **AT2** | Request Resources | AND | Storage Location | 1 | Direct interaction with storage. |
| **AT3** | Wait for Retrieval | AND | Storage Location | 1 | Passive waiting for retrieval. |
| **AT4** | Retrieve Resources | AND | Storage Location | 1 | Final action to collect resources. |
| **AT5** | Transport Resources to Destination | AND | Destination | 1 | Single robot transports resources. |
| **AT6** | Return to Charging Station | FALLBACK | Charging Station | 1 | Fallback if battery is low during collection. |
| **AT7** | Return Resource to Checkpoint | FALLBACK | Checkpoint | 1 | Fallback if battery is low during delivery. |
| **AT8** | Alert Sector Manager | ? | Sector Manager | 1 | Triggered if resource cannot be returned to checkpoint. |

